<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 NWER NYI POL NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Me Pol ji li ntiingetib a Kraist Jisos, me ji koro Esowo, á yehk-m tum tib go enyam bi elkpin ni á nyame no, ni li go abo nya Kraist Jisos, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />n kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv Timoti mmon ewame no kpo kor-m sꞌsehng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Nong Esowo Nsoo, a Kraist Jisos Ntul ewahre ka-a nnoobo, a elkoono, wo fere fil-e ndon.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pol kake Timoti eltim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Timoti, n lꞌbuum-a go egame ero bi n kpo kak atv a njul, n kpo kak Esowo saam, ye ji n kpo lok-e atahng emame saang ana babnsoo jo lim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 23:1; 24:16</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />N kpꞌbuumu ana a jolo ndon ndon, a abonngo go amahr. Owo wahnge n kpꞌsahb sꞌseb re me n tiki ba nyehn-a, eji eyebatahng lꞌsahb gbal-m gbal go egame atahng.<verse eid="2TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Me m buumu etingitingi ekakesehk ji a kpi no, elkohn ekakesehk jꞌnehm o ji nne no nkul bele no, no bo jo lung-e re Lois, jꞌnehm o ji nne Yunis tob bel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:1</char></note> N kpꞌkahne re, elkohn nꞌnehm ni a kpi no.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ano wo wahnge n kp-a kpeke buumu re, wo ko ayare nya Esowo ka-a no, nya wob-a go ega atahng, jo lim eltum, kꞌbum na bum, ayare nya a bele no eji n kun-a ebo ebame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 4:14</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Tibre Esowo wahr kaam etohko jio ji elfahle. Á ka-r etohko ji nsahm, ji li etohko ji elkoro, ji kpo lim-r, e fere jo mal bob elnahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:15</char></note><verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Owo wahnge nobo re wo kꞌjo be ndon nyi ntianse ayiimi ka Ntul ewahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:16</char></note> Ka ma jo nyaare, tib eji n wob ngbekobo go ege esi. Ga nob re wo tob taame erem tib esi jio ji nnoobo etib, ana Esowo ma-a ka eko, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Esowo bio bi ma-r tahre, fere lung-r re, wahr jol ane babe. Lohngem re eltum ni e ma lim ni wahnge á lung-r no. Á lung-r tib go ege esi, a esi ji nnoobo enye nyi á ka-r no, nyi sehnge go abo nya Kraist Jisos, njini kehm jolo. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Anv, wahr ebnyehn nnoobo nyi Esowo, eji Kraist Jisos ntꞌtahre ewahre ma ba, ye jio ji ma tane nsahm nyi elkv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:55</char></note> Yeblennge elkpin ni li go njinanjini eji á ma-r tiingi nnoobo etib.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Esowo ma-m yehke re me n tiingi nnoobo etib bio, fere jo bung alum enye, fere tob jo tib ane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 9:15</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Esi jio ji wahng ka, n kpꞌnyehne erem bia. N nehme be ndon go nsol nyio. Tibre n kpꞌkahne nne no m ma taame tv-e. N kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, á bahke ma kuuru ejum jio ji á ma-m kak go ebo tete rehng go efung bio.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Jo toono atingitingi alum nya m ma-a tib, wo sa a eltaame nꞌnehm o, a elkoro ni li go abo nya Kraist Jisos. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Jo kuuru anoobo nsol nya bo ma-a kak go ebo go nsahm nyio nyi Etingi Etohko ji wob-r go egahre atahng.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />A kpꞌkahne re, ane bao kpee ba lene go Esia ma-m sennge njahm kpee. Figelus abola Hermogenes tob wob go bo ellong. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Nong, Jehova tib ndon enye go etahk Onesiforus. M-e á nyaarem. Á jo ba nkpel a nkpele, ba kak-m eltim, jol eji n wobo wob ngbekobo. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Eji á ba rehng ga Rom, á seb-m tete, kehm-m nyehne. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Nong, á lub fili Esowo ndon efung bio. A kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn nob nob ana á jo loko eltum go Efesus.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Nnooba nne a nsoja no Jisos Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Mmon ewame, yiimi tꞌtahne go nnoobo nyi li go abo nya Kraist Jisos. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ko alum enyame nya a ma wuk go esamahr atianse gbalee, wo song tib atingitingi ane ba bahke tob mal tib ane bako.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Tob taame, nyehn erem ana nnooba nne a nsoja no Kraist Jisos. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Nne a nsoja awohng awohng limm, no lꞌkehme ebta nok, no bahke fere song kehme eljini nehka nehka lim, eji á kpꞌsebe re á lim ji kpꞌkoro ntubesi ewe no ko-e go eltum. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Mbekabahl no kpo be abahl, á nehm bel eltuuru ene, sehngem re no, á be jang jang ana eljini abahl li no. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mbahmgbe no kpo kak eko, jo lim eltum go ege egbe, ye wo fuumu re á gbo mbang li nsol alehke nyi lohng go ege egbe. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Jo tir bade alum nya n kpꞌbungu a, tibre Jehova bahk-a limi re, wo kahn ejum ajehng ajehng.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Jo buumu Jisos Kraist ji nyahme go elkv, ye ji lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Devid, ana n kpo tiingi nnoobo etib ebame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 5:5</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Nnoobo etib bi n kpo tiingi bi wahnge n kpꞌnyehne erem bia, a agbekobo go abo ana ebi nne. Alum Esowo, agbekobo wobem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 1:12-14</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Esi ji ane ba Esowo ma yehke ji wahnge n kpꞌkpuumu ejum ajehng ajehng, eji bo lꞌtob bel eltahre ni li go abo nya Kraist Jisos, ni kpo jen a ellub ni li go njinanjini.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />A wo li atingitingi alum nya bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Lꞌjol re wahr ebtob kpo a ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">e bahke tob jol a ne go elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:10-11</char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />E lꞌjo kpuumu, e bahke tob tob-e edi afili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">E lꞌten-e, á bahke tob ten-r fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:33</char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Jol afi e gbo na go ege a mbang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">ekakesehk ji Esowo jia, kpeke li nseenga nseenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">tibre Esowo nehm tiki yaange.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:3</char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nlimeltum no nno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Buumu bo nsol nyia, wo fere tong bo go esamahr Esowo re, bo kꞌkpe lim nfaabe atemtem. Nfaabe kpehme kak nne ebo, kpo rannge na ane ba lꞌwuk.<verse eid="2TI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Jo nok, eji a lꞌjol nlimeltum no nno go esamahr bi Esowo, ana nlimeltum no kil jo be ndon, eji á kpi eltum Esowo lim. Jol nne no kpo tooro atingitingi alum nya Esowo go nseenga nseenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tait 2:7-8; Mat 13:52; Luk 12:42</char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Ka jo yel go ellong ane ba kpo lim egboolo nfaabe nyi ki li nyi Esowo, tibre nsol nyio nyi kpo wahng ane gbal go abiafem. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Tibre alum ane bao li ana eyam abili, bi lꞌkehme nne yam ejang ngubjing behka, kpo tob ta yel ejang ngubjing behko. Himeneus abola Filetus, bo wob ellong ane bao fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:20</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Bo nehme kpe sehng go mbang nyi li etingitingi mbang. Bobyaange mbang nyindiki kpꞌtoono, fere bvvrv ane bandiki ntim, eji bo kpꞌtibi re elnyahme ngubjing go elkv ebsehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 2:2-3</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Nnene limm, no bahke ma yuudu nnahb ekahme nyi Esowo ma bum. Alum nyaa na abal nya, bo nyono go nnahb ekahme nyio. Nehko bungu re, “Esowo kpꞌkahne ane bao ba li babe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:14</char></note> Nehko bungu re, “Nong, nne awohng awohng no kpꞌlungu mbing nyi Kraist, á yake abꞌbi alimi.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Go egburu etahk, ajoobo nsol nyaa gbalee, ana nkpingi, nyimongo bo limi go agul, nyimongo bo limi go asilva, nsol nyimongo bo ko nti lim, nsol nyimongo bo ko ndi lim, nsol nyimongo nyi nno nyi, nsol nyimongo kpꞌsabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:24-33</char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌbum elne saang, yake nsol nyi kpꞌsabe, á bahke jolo ana ekpingi ji nno, ji bo ma bum eje eje, eji nde nne lꞌjo ko, lim ejum ajehng ajehng ji nno.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Jo jahng nsol nyi kpo melle ajangkun go bo atahng re bo jo lim. Nok, eji a lꞌli eno go esamahr Esowo, fere bel ekakesehk, a elkoro, go elkoono, wo fere woomo go ellong ane ba kpo kak ero ka Esowo a ntim ebo saang.<verse eid="2TI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Ka jo yel ellong agboolo ane ba kil kahne ejumjum, ba kpo lim nfaabe nfaabe. Tibre a kpꞌkahne re, go esꞌkohlo nfaabe nyio, ntaange nyi kpo gbo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Fuumem re nlokeltum no Jehova jo taange ntaange. Á bahke bele nnoobo eljini a nne awohng awohng, fere jol nne no kpo mal eltibi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:6</char></note> Á bahke jo kpuumu, bo lꞌlim-e ebi, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />fere jo tub ane ba kpꞌlimi nfaabe a ne elle go enange bem. Fundiki Esowo bahke limi mbang ka bo, bo gbo ndon go bo abiafem, fere kahn etingitingi, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />eji bo lꞌlohng go ekpoko bi nnehm nyi ma bob bo re bo jo lim ji kp-e koro.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Esꞌkohro afung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Jo kahne re, ngare esꞌkohro afung bahke jolo etahntahn ngare.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 4:1</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ane bahke jo tiiri elbo elbo, fere jo baare amahr akpohko, jo wor anyo, fere jo lim agabbe, jo su ane. Bo nehm jo wuk babnde ebo, saam bo nehm jo kak. Esowo nehm jo lub bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Elkoro anehng anehng bo nehm bel. Bo nehm jo tahm ka ane. Bo bahke jo kiimi afahnge lake ane. Ndon bo nehm bel. Bo bahke jo lim nsol, bo nehm jo feere njahm. Elyebe ni njini bahke jo kor bo. Esowo nehm jo kor bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Bo bahke jo bel atem go nnyo a nnyo. Bo bahke jo lim nsol go elrang elrang. Bo bahke jolo ane ba bahke jo rod elbo wahre wahre. Bo bahke jo lim ana ji kpꞌkoro bofono antahng. Esowo nehm jo kor bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Eljini ni bo, bahke jo foongo ni aneb Esowo, jol nsahm nyi bo, bo nehm bel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:15,21</char></note> Ka jo yel ellong ane bao!<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Egom ane bao bandiki bahke jo kpaale yannge go etahk ajehng ajehng, song kpiri agboolo anebkal ba ma gbal go abꞌbi, bao ba ajoobo nsol kpo melle bo go bo atahng, eji bo lꞌko bo elfono. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Bo kpo kpili na kpili kpili kpili, jol bo nehm tiki kahn etingitingi.<verse eid="2TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Ana Jannes abola Jambres jo ten Moses, ano wo fvfo ane bao ba kil elkpe ga tir nob nob kpo tob ten etingitingi. Bobgbo go mbang nyi Esowo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ekidi nehm ga lab, nne awohng awohng bahke nyehne agboolo nsol nya bo kpo lim, jang jang ana ane nyehne goji Jannes a Jambres.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eljini ni nne Esowo bahke jo lim, kehm jo gbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Wo Timoti, wobwuk eltibi ename, fere nyehn eljini ename. A kpꞌkahne ji wahnge n kpi elkpin ana nia. A nyꞌnyehn ekakesehk ejame, fere nyehn ana n jolo soom. A nyꞌnyehn elkoro ename, fere nyehn ana n jo kpuumu. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />A nyꞌnyehn ana bo jo gbak-m, fere nyehn ana n jo nyehn erem go Antiok, a Ikonium, go Listra, fere nyehn ana n kpuumu elgbake nio kpee. Jehova ma-m tahre yehke go nsol nyio kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:50; 14:5,19</char></note><verse eid="2TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtong re á bahke toono Kraist Jisos, fere jo lim eljini ni Esowo, á bahke tiki jo nyehn erem bi ane bahke jo gbak-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 14:22</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Abi ane, a ane ba kpo nehm ane, bo kpꞌsoro asi go abꞌbi alimi sehnge ana wuku wuku. Bo kpo nehm ane bako, fere tob nehm elbo.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Timoti, soro asi, wo jo lim nsol nyi a ma kpili, fere taame tv, eji a kpꞌkahne nne no tib-a no. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />A bomo nwer Esowo akahne ngare nyi a jolo ntiil tete sik anv. Nwer nyio bahk-a ma ka elkahne ni a bahke kahne mbang nyi eltahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:39</char></note> Eltahre nio li go abo nya Kraist Jisos.<verse eid="2TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Alum Esowo kpee lohng goji Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 1:19-21</char></note> eji lꞌlim nnoobo ka ane. Alum Esowo kpo tib etingitingi, fere jo nyam ane, jo soongo bo, fere jo rehke bo re bo jol go etingitingi, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />eji nne Esowo lꞌjol nob nob, fere jo mal ellimi eltum anehng anehng ni nno.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Ana Pol jo rehke Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Erehke ji n kp-a kake a, n kp-a kake go esamahr bi Esowo, a bi Jisos Kraist, ye ji bahke lame aneb mbir mbir, a ba ma kpo. Tib go elbake ene ni á bahke bake ba ji go ege a nji etul, owo wahnge n kp-a tongo re, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />wo jo bung alum Esowo, kꞌjo be ndon, afi jolo ngare anyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:20,31</char></note> Jo lennge abiafem tong bo, wo fere jo nyam bo, fere jo rehke bo. Lim nsol nyia kpee go mbang nyi a kpꞌtibi na bo, a elkpuumu.<verse eid="2TI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Tibre ngare kpꞌbake nyi ane lꞌkꞌkpe jo kor bo re bo jo wuungu atung go etingitingi eltibi. Bo bahke jo toono ana ji bo bahke jo tir go bo a ntim. Bo bahke jo lim elbo, eji bo bahke jo seb atꞌtibi ba bahke jo tib bo nsol nyi bahke jo yebe bo go atung. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Bo bahke sennge etingitingi njahm, fere jo wuungu atung go aka nya li ana amongo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 2:11</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Wo, jo kunu elna ekpu go ejum ajehng ajehng! Jo kpuumu erem, wo fere jo lim eltum ni alum Esowo abungu. Jo lim eltum ena nseenga nseenge!<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Tibre afung nya m bahke tahme njini nyia sa ebbiingi. Bo ma-m rod kpꞌyaange wohng go ana alahb njom ma Esowo, ma bo kpo yaange wohng go.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:17</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Me n nok ebta ebame go mbang nyi nno. Me n gohro be abahl enyame. Me m bel ekakesehk go eltoono mbang nyi Esowo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Anv, ekpasi eltuuru jia, nong-m go esꞌsong, ekpasi jio ji eno ji Esowo bi li nnooba nlamalam bahk-m tuuru efung bio. Me ntahngtahng sang á bahk-m tuuru. Á bahke tob tuuru nne awohng awohng no elbake ni á bahke bake kp-e koro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:4; Jems 1:12; Ell 2:10</char></note><verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alum nya Pol gohro bung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Lim, wo gulu elbake ga egame. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Tibre Demas, njini nyia m-e kehme elkoro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:14</char></note> Á ma-m tahm sa, tahm eje go Tesalonaika. Kresens ebtahm go Galesa. Taitus ebtahm go Dalmesa. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luk ntahngtahng wo ma sa a name. Ko Mak, wo ba a ne, tibre á bahk-m ma kak ebo go eltum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 15:37; Kol 4:10</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Me n tum Tikikus tv go Efesus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:4; Ef 6:21; Kol 4:7</char></note><verse eid="2TI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />A lꞌkehm bake, soro ko ekpawobo ejame ji n tahme sa go etahk nsoo Karpus go Troas, ba ka-m. Tob ko awer enyame ba a nya, asehngesehnge awer nya n kpo nyon nsol.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Aleksanda ntahletahl lim-m egburu ebi sehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:20</char></note> Esowo bahk-e bongo jang jang ana á limi no. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Wofono antahng, jo kun-e ekpu, tibre á tohkem tꞌtaame tv alum enyahre nya e jo bung.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Go egame elam, eji n gbo mbang tooro nnyo elam emame, nnene jolem no yiim-m njahm. Bo kpee yaam-m sa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 1:15</char></note> Nong, Esowo lub tahm ka bo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Esowo bi yiim-m njahm, fere ka-m eko, eji etib ebame lꞌyiimi, ane baka baka ba ki nyi Esowo lꞌwuk. Ano wo wahnge á tahr-m no yehke go nnyo mi egabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 23:11; 27:23-24</char></note><verse eid="2TI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Esowo bahk-m tahre yehke go nfem anyehng anyehng, fere kp-m tahm a name go ejahbetul eje. Nong, ellub jol a ne go njinanjini. Emen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyo mi Pol gohro kak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Kak Priska abola Akwila nnyo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 18:2; Rom 16:3</char></note> wo fere kak Onesiforus nnyo, a aneb etahk ebe. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erastus sa go Korint.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:22</char></note> Trofimus, n tahm-e sa go Miletus, á kpꞌyame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:4; 21:29</char></note><verse eid="2TI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Lim, wo ba ga egame, elkoko kehm rehnge. Yubulus, Pudens, Lenus, a Klodia, bo kpee tong-m re me n kak-a nnyo. Abon Esowo bako go tob tong-m re me n kak-a nnyo.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Nong, Esowo jol a etohko eja. Nnoobo nyi Esowo jol a na. Emen.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>